WEBVTT

00:00:12.614 --> 00:00:14.616
HARRY:Come on.

00:00:14.616 --> 00:00:15.835
RON:
What?

00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:17.576
You heard
what Hagrid said,

00:00:17.576 --> 00:00:19.534
"Follow the spiders."

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:22.146
They're heading
to the Dark Forest.

00:00:24.322 --> 00:00:26.062
Why spiders?

00:00:26.062 --> 00:00:28.369
Why couldn't it be,
"Follow the butterflies"?

00:00:39.337 --> 00:00:42.296
[WIND WHISTLING]

00:00:42.296 --> 00:00:44.907
[WOLF HOWLS IN DISTANCE]

00:01:04.623 --> 00:01:06.102
Harry,
I don't like this.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:13.762
Harry, I don't
like this at all.

00:01:13.762 --> 00:01:15.460
Shush.

00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:29.256
Can we go back now?

00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:31.258
Come on.

00:02:17.913 --> 00:02:19.698
[BRANCHES THRASH]

00:02:21.047 --> 00:02:24.137
RASPY VOICE:
Who is it?

00:02:24.137 --> 00:02:25.878
Don't panic.[FANG BARKS]

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:27.749
RASPY VOICE:
Hagrid?

00:02:27.749 --> 00:02:29.751
Is that you?[BRANCHES THRASH]

00:02:29.751 --> 00:02:32.188
We're friends of Hagrid's.

00:02:49.815 --> 00:02:52.208
And you? You're--

00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:53.558
You're Aragog, aren't you?

00:02:53.558 --> 00:02:55.603
Yes.

00:02:55.603 --> 00:02:59.085
Hagrid has never sent men
into our hollow before.

00:02:59.085 --> 00:03:00.652
He's in trouble.

00:03:00.652 --> 00:03:02.741
Up at the school,
there have been attacks.

00:03:02.741 --> 00:03:05.265
They think it's Hagrid.

00:03:05.265 --> 00:03:07.441
They think he opened
the Chamber of Secrets,

00:03:07.441 --> 00:03:08.964
like before.

00:03:08.964 --> 00:03:11.837
That's a lie!

00:03:11.837 --> 00:03:14.970
Hagrid never opened
the Chamber of Secrets.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:17.321
Then you're not the monster?

00:03:17.321 --> 00:03:18.844
No.

00:03:18.844 --> 00:03:20.802
The monster
was born in the castle.

00:03:20.802 --> 00:03:25.329
I came to Hagrid
from a distant land...

00:03:25.329 --> 00:03:27.156
in the pocket of a traveler.

00:03:27.156 --> 00:03:28.419
[WHIMPERS]
Harry...

00:03:28.419 --> 00:03:29.376
Shush.

00:03:31.247 --> 00:03:33.554
But if you're not the monster,

00:03:33.554 --> 00:03:35.904
then what did kill that girl
50 years ago?

00:03:35.904 --> 00:03:39.604
We do not speak of it.

00:03:39.604 --> 00:03:41.170
It is
an ancient creature

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:45.044
we spiders fear
above all others.

00:03:45.044 --> 00:03:46.915
But have you seen it?

00:03:46.915 --> 00:03:50.397
I never saw
any part of the castle,

00:03:50.397 --> 00:03:53.748
but the box
in which Hagrid kept me.

00:03:53.748 --> 00:03:57.230
The girl was discovered
in a bathroom.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:00.886
When I was accused,
Hagrid brought me here.

00:04:00.886 --> 00:04:02.409
Harry...

00:04:02.409 --> 00:04:03.541
What?

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:20.296
Well, thank you.

00:04:20.296 --> 00:04:22.560
We'll just go.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.823
Go?

00:04:24.823 --> 00:04:27.216
I think not.

00:04:27.216 --> 00:04:29.262
My sons and daughters

00:04:29.262 --> 00:04:33.397
do not harm Hagrid
on my command,

00:04:33.397 --> 00:04:35.355
but I cannot deny them
fresh meat

00:04:35.355 --> 00:04:39.446
when it wanders
so willingly into our midst.

00:04:39.446 --> 00:04:42.710
Goodbye,
friend of Hagrid.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.365
Can we panic now?

00:04:55.506 --> 00:04:57.595
Know any spells?

00:04:57.595 --> 00:04:59.205
One, but it's not
powerful enough

00:04:59.205 --> 00:05:00.554
for all of them.

00:05:00.554 --> 00:05:03.035
Where's Hermione
when you need her?

00:05:17.484 --> 00:05:19.007
Let's go!

00:05:24.099 --> 00:05:25.405
Arania Exumai!

00:05:31.759 --> 00:05:32.891
Go!

00:05:43.771 --> 00:05:45.251
Whoa!
Whoa!

00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:52.084
Glad we're out of there!

00:05:59.787 --> 00:06:01.702
Arania Exumai!

00:06:07.273 --> 00:06:09.101
Thanks for that.

00:06:09.101 --> 00:06:11.059
Don't mention it.

00:06:22.288 --> 00:06:23.898
Get us out of here.

00:06:25.073 --> 00:06:26.118
Now!

00:06:28.903 --> 00:06:33.778
Come on!
Come on, move faster!

00:06:33.778 --> 00:06:35.431
[SCREAMING]

00:06:35.431 --> 00:06:36.781
Come on!

00:06:36.781 --> 00:06:38.043
Go!

00:06:54.755 --> 00:06:55.930
Get us in the air.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.845
[GEARS GRINDING]

00:06:57.845 --> 00:06:59.455
The flying gear's jammed!

00:07:03.895 --> 00:07:05.940
Come on! Pull!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.333
I'm trying!

